recommend keep-going — the keyed wing is whole (de-esser, ducker, keyed gate). The next self-approvable crux is a carried/spanning de-esser (threading the band-pass and follower states so it can automate) or the lookahead delay line horizon (a true brickwall limiter — that one waits for Keaton's word). External key routing and real hardware stay custody gates.
